1 CO WF-003 WF-007~ WF-021~ | Evidence of completion matched to scope/risk; no unconfigured optional tooling required.
2 CO WF-004 TST-010~ SEC-001~ | Final diff/scope review before checks; no accidental artifacts or secrets; probes removed only after their behavior is preserved.
