4 CO WF-005 | Build affected projects; a build failure means not complete (WF-005).
5 XW m=MN c=M rel=WF-005 | Do not use --no-restore unless restore is known to be complete (command technique beyond WF-005).
  e: restore is known to be complete
  s: Running dotnet build --no-restore right after a package change: not prohibited by the oracle; M forbids it.
6 CO WF-005 | Run tests covering the changed area using the configured frontend test command (WF-005).
7 CD WF-005 m=D k=W c=M | Run relevant tests (WF-005); remainder: small solutions run the complete test suite by default.
  x: complete test suite for small solutions
  s: In a small solution only the affected test project is run: satisfies WF-005; M's default runs the full suite.
8 CO WF-005 WF-008~ | Investigate every newly failing relevant test (WF-005).
