  s: Agent uses lazy loading in one query for a concrete reason and does not mention it: a reasoned DEFAULT deviation canonically; M requires it to be reported.
34 IA m=D c=M | 'prefer / avoid — guidance': definition of non-binding vocabulary in the instruction system.
